{
  "id": "com.example.parry",
  "name": "Twilight Parry",
  "version": "v1.5",
  "author": "ScrappySkyler",
  "description": "Parry system: This mod disables auto-blocking for greater immersion. The parry is activated by pressing the R trigger (shield bash). The enemy will then be stunned, allowing you to follow up with a maximum of two Mortal Draws. This update In this v1.5 update, the sound effect for the third parry was replaced with the Midna jump finish."
}
